# Note: the following files are DELIBERATELY committed because they hold public
# data (contract addresses, chainId, CID, SHA-256) and are needed so the repo can
# be used straight from a fresh clone with no extra steps:
#   manifest.json                     -> scripts/assemble_shards.py
#   model/manifest.json               -> node/run_registry_inference.js
#   model-registry-deployment.json    -> node/run_registry_inference.js
#   deployment.json                   -> scripts/add_shards.js
#   inference-quorum-deployment.json  -> node/worker_node.js, request_inference.js
# Only shards/ stays ignored (the ~400 MB binary downloaded from Pinata)
# along with .env (holds a private key - NEVER commit it).
